      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abbeville%2C_South_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Confederate President Jefferson Davis stayed at the Burt-Stark Mansion in Abbeville to dissolve the Confederacy in 1865.",
